        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 14,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "When the woman of Tekoa spoke to the king, she fell on her face to the ground, showed respect, and said, “Help, O king!”",
      "ko": "드고아 여인이 왕께 고할 때에 얼굴을 땅에 대고 엎드려 가로되 왕이여 도우소서",
      "source_text_hash": "76c018379c92dbc1e3df150327be5886d1e53f874a2cacc4748020423f3a6cab",
      "translation_text_hash": "b2321c1a90a037bdbb5a1a577c8d80963b2e6fdc09941c0325723cb576a56dca",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "드고아 여인이 왕께 고할 때에 얼굴을 땅에 대고 엎드려 가로되 왕이여 도우소서"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b2321c1a90a037bdbb5a1a577c8d80963b2e6fdc09941c0325723cb576a56dca"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2SA:14:5",
      "sequence": 8362,
      "chapter_label": "2SA 14",
