      "en": "Three sons were born to Absalom, and one daughter, whose name was Tamar. She was a woman with a beautiful face.",
      "ko": "압살롬이 아들 셋과 딸 하나를 낳았는데 딸의 이름은 다말이라 얼굴이 아름다운 여자더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a4feaf3250791c98eaccd992e088e2bc7b16087bca15f7d292a73a82c63fb0c8",
      "translation_text_hash": "dccf37a112762881c23d53a375f3c838e9ee793f76e9ecf9c49676d5fc3499c9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
